WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.740
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: You are NOT the Lion

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:05.740
King!

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:06.740
Dr. Bright!

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.690
Disney movies are not real life!

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:12.880
This especially goes for your most recent
obsession: the Lion King.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:18.199
Stop holding SCP-529 up in the air, stop smearing
ketchup on people's foreheads in the canteen

00:00:18.199 --> 00:00:25.350
and saying "Simba," and definitely stop saying
"Everything the Bright touches is our kingdom."

